# Footer version (InPmnt)

Every shippable build must show the current software version on the **main/landing page footer**.

- Keep root `VERSION` and any PHP/Python constants in lockstep (`Http::VERSION`, template `app_version`).
- Footer line shape: `© … · InPmnt · MIT License` plus a clear version (e.g. `v1.4.10` or `Revision 1.4.10`).
- When bumping a release, update the footer source of truth — never leave a stale version on `/`.
